{
  "id": "mv8-s2",
  "duration": 27.121,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "The beetle's heaven and the human's trap",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.183
    },
    {
      "text": "run on one ancient circuit, yes —",
      "start": 2.461,
      "end": 4.957
    },
    {
      "text": "but the circuit also made this:",
      "start": 5.341,
      "end": 7.268
    },
    {
      "text": "the pale bowl, the gold cone, the fever, the perfume",
      "start": 7.709,
      "end": 12.074
    },
    {
      "text": "strong enough to cross a hundred million years",
      "start": 12.132,
      "end": 14.396
    },
    {
      "text": "and find one primate, melancholy on a Tuesday,",
      "start": 14.605,
      "end": 18.03
    },
    {
      "text": "leaning in like a fool at a shrine,",
      "start": 18.205,
      "end": 20.306
    },
    {
      "text": "and — knowing everything —",
      "start": 20.515,
      "end": 22.071
    },
    {
      "text": "leaning in anyway,",
      "start": 22.28,
      "end": 23.592
    },
    {
      "text": "and being, for one unrepeatable lungful,",
      "start": 23.708,
      "end": 26.227
    },
    {
      "text": "glad.",
      "start": 26.32,
      "end": 27.121
    }
  ]
}